Date: Thu, 21 Sep 2023 09:32:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 460/913] plat-stm32mp1: conf: enable nvmem support for TAMP
 Backup registers

TAMP backup registers allow information sharing between different
software components/execution levels.
They are described individually as nvmem cells.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git f1dec8d867ae12e1b44cfee642fbfbf930cc5d16 plat-stm32mp1: conf: enable nvmem support for TAMP Backup registers]
Change-Id: I8c91791daa44ccb15bbbeaa7ff6d2dc0f261b166
Signed-off-by: Simeon Marijon <simeon.marijon@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/328925
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/351781
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk
index 6875ad5a4..e8fcc1678 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk
+++ b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk
@@ -404,6 +404,8 @@ ifeq ($(CFG_TA_STM32MP_NVMEM),y)
 $(call force,CFG_STM32_BSEC_PTA,y,Required by CFG_TA_STM32MP_NVMEM)
 CFG_IN_TREE_EARLY_TAS += stm32mp_nvmem/1a8342cc-81a5-4512-99fe-9e2b3e37d626
 endif
+CFG_DRIVERS_NVMEM ?= y
+CFG_STM32_TAMP_NVRAM ?= y
 
 # Default enable PKCS11 TA to have PKCS11 tests built in OP-TEE Test
 CFG_PKCS11_TA ?= y
